          "sourcePage": 51,
          "sourceRegion": "Question 5 diagram below the stem on the left",
          "description": "Unshaded major sector with an open wedge at the top, a 13 cm label on the left radius and a reflex angle marker labelled 230° inside the retained sector.",
          "mathematics": "Two equal radii bound a retained 230° sector; the omitted wedge is 130°. The major arc runs around the sides and bottom.",
          "answerVisibility": "All geometry and labels are permanent student-visible givens; no answer is included."
        },
        "derived": false,
        "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
